          "description": "The colors to build around, one per entry, in slot order: the first entry is slot 1. Leave an entry empty, or write N, for a slot Colormind should fill; fewer than five entries leave the remaining slots free. At least one color and at most four, since a palette has five slots. A hex code such as D64E45 or #D64E45, rgb(214, 78, 69), or three numbers from 0 to 255 all work, as does a color from an earlier step.",
