  "description": "Generate color palettes with Colormind, the free keyless color scheme generator driven by a deep learning model trained on photographs, film stills and popular art. Get a five-color palette from nothing, build one around the colors you already have, ask what goes with a single color, or get a UI palette with a light shade, two accents, the main brand color and a dark shade built around your brand color. Draw from the general default model, the ui model, or one of the models that rotate in daily, trained on a film, a game or a style of photography, and check which are loaded before a step relies on one.",
